<title>ITALY: Massimo Gentilini new Fiat Poland chief.</title>
<headline>Massimo Gentilini new Fiat Poland chief.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Fiat SpA said it has named Massimo Gentilini as president of Fiat Auto Poland, its Polish subsidiary which produces the Cinquecento model.</p>
<p>Fiat said in a statement that Gentilini replaces Diego Avesani, who will head up Fiat Auto's medium-to-top range model development group.</p>
<p>Born in 1943, Gentilini joined Fiat Auto in 1967. He was previously a manager with Fiat Automoveis, Brazil.</p>
<p>((-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589 ))</p>
